pan style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        敢傻敢衝\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        gǎn shǎ gǎn chōng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        拯救世界越用力就越感動\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        zhěng jiù shì jiè yuè yòng lì jiù yuè gǎn dòng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        請抓住我的手\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        qǐng zhuā zhù wǒ de shǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        讓我們繼續走\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        ràng wǒ men jì xù zǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        我相信敢傻是 我的本事\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        wǒ xiāng xìn gǎn shǎ shì wǒ de běn shì\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        傻了嗎 衝了嗎\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        shǎ le ma chōng le ma\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        準備出發\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        zhǔn bèi chū fā\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span style=\"display: bl